#. module: social_media_x
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:social_media_x.field_social_account__x_premium
msgid ""
"Whether this account holds an X Premium subscription, which raises the "
"message of a post from 280 to 25 000 characters. Left off, a post longer "
"than 280 characters is refused before it is sent. Turned on for an account "
"that does not hold the subscription, the post is sent and X refuses it, and "
"the publication fails with the reason X gives."
msgstr ""

